#N canvas 20 20 2600 2200 12;
#X text 20 20 c_steps -- a 16-step sequencer: sixteen tracks of sixteen steps \, a velocity per step \, played on its own c_clock. It knows steps \, velocity levels and pads \, never where they sit on a surface: that is the m_ boundary. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 58;
#X text 20 150 creation arg 1: the 404 bank its sixteen tracks play \, 1 for A. creation arg 2: the part its pattern is stored as \, drums for section-1-drums. inlet: step <n> <velocity> \, vel <level> <velocity> \, pad <n> <velocity>. outlet 1: pad <1..160> <velocity> \, to m_404. outlet 2: the drum page's state \, to g_grid -- steps <16 velocities> \, play <step> \, vel <level> \, track <pad>., f 58;
